#     below). Two things worth flagging from this cycle in their own right:
#       1. The new "not observed within 10s; proceeding anyway" fallback fired correctly
#          and did not hang — validates the cap half of the "poll 500ms, cap 10s" design.
#       2. try#1's clean sub-attempt landed a handshake on the FIRST try (501ms, no rekey
